# The image is built from Warhammer/ (the app), Warhammer.Tests/ (run against
# the exported data before publishing), docker/ (nginx config) and
# tools/war-data/ (the pin and the export script) only. Everything else is
# excluded so tools, docs and local build output never enter the build context
# or bust the layer cache. So are a local export of the WAR data and its stamp
# and typst cache: the image always exports the data at the pin itself.
*
!Warhammer/
!Warhammer.Tests/
!docker/
!tools/war-data/

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/
Warhammer/docs/
**/*.user
tools/war-data/.cache/
tools/war-data/.exported
Warhammer/wwwroot/data/war/*
!Warhammer/wwwroot/data/war/core-rules.json
!Warhammer/wwwroot/data/war/troop-types.json
